{
  "id": "ethos-scan-adult",
  "title": {
    "en": "1B Values and Norms Scan & Values-Behavior Discrepancy Scan",
    "nl": "1B Waarden- en Normen scan & Scan Waarden-Gedrag Discrepantie"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "The goal of the scan is to gain insight into how well your personal core values guide your daily choices and behavior.",
    "nl": "Het doel van de scan is: Inzicht krijgen in hoe goed je persoonlijke kernwaarden je dagelijkse keuzes en gedrag sturen."
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "core-values",
      "title": {
        "en": "Core Values Selection",
        "nl": "Kernwaarden Selectie"
      },
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "core-values-selection",
          "type": "multi-choice-selection",
          "text": {
            "en": "Core values are the driving forces that determine what you truly value in your life and work. They form your moral compass for choices and behavior. Therefore, choose a maximum of four core values that best suit you below.",
            "nl": "Kernwaarden zijn de drijfveren die bepalen wat jij écht belangrijk vindt in je leven en werk. Ze vormen je morele kompas bij keuzes en gedrag. Kies daarom hieronder maximaal 4 kernwaarden die het beste bij jou passen."
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "connection",
              "label": {
                "en": "Connection: Collaboration, Empathy, Loyalty, Solidarity",
                "nl": "Verbinding: Samenwerking, Empathie, Loyaliteit, Solidariteit"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "integrity",
              "label": {
                "en": "Integrity: Honesty, Transparency, Reliability, Equality",
                "nl": "Integriteit: Eerlijkheid, Transparantie, Betrouwbaarheid, Gelijkwaardigheid"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "growth",
              "label": {
                "en": "Growth and Development: Curiosity, Personal Growth, Creativity, Adventure",
                "nl": "Groei en Ontwikkeling: Leergierigheid, Persoonlijke groei, Creativiteit, Avontuur"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "autonomy",
              "label": {
                "en": "Autonomy: Freedom, Self-Determination, Entrepreneurship",
                "nl": "Autonomie: Vrijheid, Zelfbeschikking, Ondernemerschap"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "results",
              "label": {
                "en": "Results: Purposefulness, Efficiency, Quality, Impact",
                "nl": "Resultaat: Doelgerichtheid, Efficiëntie, Kwaliteit, Impact"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "care",
              "label": {
                "en": "People & Care: Caring, Well-being, Respect, Safety",
                "nl": "Mens & Zorg: Zorgzaamheid, Welzijn, Respect, Veiligheid"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "innovation",
              "label": {
                "en": "Innovation: Renewal, Courage, Visionary Thinking",
                "nl": "Innovatie: Vernieuwing, Durf, Visionair denken"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "sustainability",
              "label": {
                "en": "Sustainability: Sustainability, Responsibility",
                "nl": "Duurzaamheid: Duurzaamheid, Verantwoordelijkheid"
              }
            }
          ],
          "validation": {
            "required": true,
            "minSelections": 4,
            "maxSelections": 4,
            "message": {
              "en": "Check if exactly 4 core values are chosen",
              "nl": "Check of precies 4 kernwaarden zijn gekozen"
            }
          },
          "editEnabled": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "statements",
      "title": {
        "en": "Statements",
        "nl": "Stellingen"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Read each statement carefully and indicate to what extent you agree:",
