          "en": "1 = Strongly disagree\n2 = Disagree\n3 = Neutral\n4 = Agree\n5 = Strongly agree",
          "nl": "1 = Helemaal oneens\n2 = Oneens\n3 = Neutraal\n4 = Eens\n5 = Helemaal eens"
